# Everything `zig build` produces: the install prefix (binaries, and the docs
# from `zig build docs`) and the local build cache. Both are derived from the
# source in this repo, and the cache is machine-specific.
zig-out/
.zig-cache/
# What that cache was called before Zig 0.13, in case an older toolchain runs.
zig-cache/

# Ad-hoc builds that bypass `zig build` - `zig build-exe`, `zig build-lib`,
# `zig test some_file.zig` - drop their output next to the source instead.
*.exe
*.pdb
*.obj
*.o
*.lib
*.a

# Editor and OS leavings.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
